                <pb facs="0773" n="723" sameAs="frus:frus1894/pg723"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Gresham to Mr. Terrell.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-12-24"><hi rendition="#italic">December 24,
                        1894</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Sultan having refused permission Jewett to go you will not press further.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Gresham.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
